<title>USA: FINOVA Group unit to issue $100 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>FINOVA Group unit to issue $100 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>FINOVA Group unit, FINOVA Capital Corp, is slated to bring a $100 million debt offering via lead underwriter Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, corporate bond syndicate sources said on Monday.</p>
<p>The Baa1/A-minus rated deal is expected to include a seven-year maturity and is seen pricing at a spread of between 55 to 57 basis points over U.S. Treasuries, sources said.</p>
<p>FINOVA Capital Corp is the principal subsidiary of the commercial finance company FINOVA Group Inc.</p>
<p>(( -- Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
